{"version":1,"content":"<p>隨着備受期待的《俠盜獵車手VI》（GTA VI）即將正式發售，全球各地玩家的熱情持續升温。一些企業開始擔憂大量員工可能會為了體驗新作而請假甚至「裝病缺勤」。不過，電腦外設製造商羅技選擇了一種截然不同的應對方式：主動為員工提供帶薪假期，讓他們安心玩遊戲。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1585956.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T13:38:57.024729+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T13:23:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T13:32:15.793678+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T13:32:15.793678+00:00","content_hash":"016a6f99d7d02acc4e61b4d0ac3d994677e6ab9bfe40354d41d7c5b89290076b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}